---
<div class="my-10 p-8 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-[#0B1120] rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-700 shadow-sm relative flex flex-col items-center">
  <div class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-slate-400 dark:text-navy-400 uppercase mb-8 text-center">The Leveraged Investor Rollover Decision</div>

  <div class="w-full max-w-3xl flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-6 items-stretch">
    
    {/* 2026 Scenario */}
    <div class="flex-1 bg-white dark:bg-navy-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-700 rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm flex flex-col relative overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1 bg-emerald-500"></div>
      <div class="text-center mb-6">
        <div class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 uppercase mb-1">Entry: 2026</div>
        <div class="text-lg font-black text-slate-800 dark:text-white uppercase">The Spread Works</div>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-4 flex-1">
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center pb-3 border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-navy-800">
          <span class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">FCNR Yield</span>
          <span class="text-sm font-black text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">6.5%</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center pb-3 border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-navy-800">
          <span class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Borrowing Cost</span>
          <span class="text-sm font-bold text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400">&minus; 4.0%</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center pt-2">
          <span class="text-sm font-black uppercase text-slate-800 dark:text-white">Net Spread</span>
          <span class="text-lg font-black text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">+ 2.5%</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="mt-6 bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-900/20 border border-emerald-200 dark:border-emerald-800/40 py-2 rounded text-center">
        <span class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-bold uppercase text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 tracking-wider">Action: Invest & Hold</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* VS Divider */}
    <div class="hidden md:flex flex-col items-center justify-center">
      <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-slate-200 dark:bg-navy-700 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 z-10 ring-4 ring-slate-50 dark:ring-[#0B1120]">
        VS
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* 2029 Scenario */}
    <div class="flex-1 bg-white dark:bg-navy-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-700 rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm flex flex-col relative overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1 bg-rose-500"></div>
      <div class="text-center mb-6">
        <div class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 uppercase mb-1">Maturity: 2029</div>
        <div class="text-lg font-black text-slate-800 dark:text-white uppercase">The Spread Inverts</div>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-4 flex-1">
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center pb-3 border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-navy-800">
          <span class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">FCNR Yield (Normalised)</span>
          <span class="text-sm font-black text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">3.5%</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center pb-3 border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-navy-800">
          <span class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Borrowing Cost</span>
          <span class="text-sm font-bold text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400">&minus; 5.0%</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center pt-2">
          <span class="text-sm font-black uppercase text-slate-800 dark:text-white">Net Spread</span>
          <span class="text-lg font-black text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400">&minus; 1.5%</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="mt-6 bg-rose-50 dark:bg-rose-900/20 border border-rose-200 dark:border-rose-800/40 py-2 rounded text-center">
        <span class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-bold uppercase text-rose-700 dark:text-rose-400 tracking-wider">Action: Unwind & Exit</span>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <div class="mt-8 text-center max-w-xl">
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 italic">For a leveraged investor, the decision is entirely mathematical. If the gross spread turns negative at maturity, the capital will exit regardless of India's macroeconomic narrative.</p>
  </div>
</div>
